  "body": "[Replaceable] is generally used to work around legacy compat problems. Did that occur for `window.cookieStore`? If so, noting that in the document might be a good idea. If not, then I'd suggest removing it.\r\n\r\nIt certainly doesn't seem necessary for `ServiceWorkerGlobalScope`.",
